Game Copyright Notice (Majesty 2)
----------------------------------------------------------------------

This project is an independent, fan-made Chinese localization ("translation
patch") for the video game "Majesty 2" (Majesty 2 Collection, including its
expansions). It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by the
copyright holders of that game.

Majesty 2 and all related titles, characters, artwork, music, and
trademarks are the property of their respective copyright holders,
including but not limited to:

    - 1C Company / Ino-Co (original developer)
    - Paradox Interactive (publisher)

Copyright (c) their respective owners. All rights reserved.

This project distributes NO copyrighted game assets. It provides only
translation text, font atlases, and a runtime injection loader that users
must apply to their own legally acquired copies of the game. The game
itself is not redistributed by this project and remains governed by its
own license.

----------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party Components
----------------------------------------------------------------------

This patch bundles or depends on the following third-party components.
Their licenses are reproduced verbatim in ./LICENSES/ and merged into
License.txt inside each distributed package:

    - Ultimate ASI Loader (winmm.dll), by ThirteenAG
      MIT License. See ./LICENSES/ASILoader.txt
    - Source Han Serif (font used for the CJK atlas)
      See ./LICENSES/source-han-serif.txt
    - GNU Unifont (fallback glyphs)
      See ./LICENSES/unifont.txt
    - DirectXTex texconv (build-time only)
      See ./LICENSES/texconv.txt

The compiled binary produced by this project
(MajestyII_GB18030_2000.asi) is a derived work of this project's own
source and is distributed under the same GPL-3.0-or-later terms as above.

